   "md_text": "![[road sign: a red circle with an upper left to lower right diagonal over a black arrow that goes up, to the left and then down; background is a white square]](../assets/compositionality/nouturn.jpg) ![[road sign: a black arrow going up and bending to the left; the word 'ONLY' is below it; background is a white square]](../assets/compositionality/bearleftonly.jpg) ![[road sign: a red circle with an upper left to lower right diagonal over a black iconic truck; background is a white square]](../assets/compositionality/notrucks.jpg) ![[road sign: green square with a white arrow that goes up then splits with one arrow bending left and one bending right; below the arrow are the words '1 MILE'; above the left is an interstate logo with the number '10'; above the right is an interstate logo with"
